// `when_true` where the mask is true and `when_false` where it is
// false, all three broadcasting by `ndshape.broadcast`.
//
// The shape-preserving companion to `select`: this is how a column is
// cleaned in place — `where(mask, a, scalar(0.0))` — without changing
// what fits beside it.
